@host = http://localhost:5299

### Seed CS301 — capacity 2, prerequisite CS101
POST {{host}}/courses
Content-Type: application/json

{ "courseId": "CS301", "capacity": 2, "prerequisiteCourseId": "CS101" }

### Seed CS302 — capacity 1, prerequisite MATH101
POST {{host}}/courses
Content-Type: application/json

{ "courseId": "CS302", "capacity": 1, "prerequisiteCourseId": "MATH101" }

### Seed learners
POST {{host}}/learners
Content-Type: application/json

{ "learnerId": "Alice", "completedCourses": ["CS101"] }

###
POST {{host}}/learners
Content-Type: application/json

{ "learnerId": "Bob", "completedCourses": ["CS101"] }

###
POST {{host}}/learners
Content-Type: application/json

{ "learnerId": "Carol", "completedCourses": [] }

###
POST {{host}}/learners
Content-Type: application/json

{ "learnerId": "Dave", "completedCourses": ["CS101"] }

###
POST {{host}}/learners
Content-Type: application/json

{ "learnerId": "Erin", "completedCourses": [] }

### Step 1 — Expect: 201, Enrolled
POST {{host}}/enrollments
Content-Type: application/json

{ "courseId": "CS301", "learnerId": "Alice" }

### Step 2 — Expect: 201, Enrolled (course now full 2/2)
POST {{host}}/enrollments
Content-Type: application/json

{ "courseId": "CS301", "learnerId": "Bob" }

### Step 3 — Expect: 201, Waitlisted (full, Carol ineligible, gate-at-the-seat)
POST {{host}}/enrollments
Content-Type: application/json

{ "courseId": "CS301", "learnerId": "Carol" }

### Step 4 — Expect: 201, Waitlisted
POST {{host}}/enrollments
Content-Type: application/json

{ "courseId": "CS301", "learnerId": "Dave" }

### Step 5 — Expect: 409 Conflict (Alice already enrolled)
POST {{host}}/enrollments
Content-Type: application/json

{ "courseId": "CS301", "learnerId": "Alice" }

### Step 6 — Expect: 409 Conflict (Carol already waitlisted)
POST {{host}}/enrollments
Content-Type: application/json

{ "courseId": "CS301", "learnerId": "Carol" }

### Check status before drop — Expect: enrolled=[Alice,Bob], waitlist=[Carol,Dave]
GET {{host}}/courses/CS301/status

### Step 7 — Drop Alice. Expect: Dropped; Dave promoted (Carol skipped, stays waitlisted)
DELETE {{host}}/enrollments/CS301/Alice

### Check status after drop 1 — Expect: enrolled=[Bob,Dave], waitlist=[Carol]
GET {{host}}/courses/CS301/status

### Step 8 — Carol completes the prerequisite while waiting — Expect: 200
PATCH {{host}}/learners/Carol
Content-Type: application/json

{ "completedCourses": ["CS101"] }

### Step 9 — Drop Bob. Expect: Dropped; Carol now promoted (now eligible)
DELETE {{host}}/enrollments/CS301/Bob

### Check status after drop 2 — Expect: enrolled=[Dave,Carol], waitlist=[] (full again, 2/2)
GET {{host}}/courses/CS301/status

### Step 10 — Enroll Erin, course full again, Erin ineligible — Expect: 201, Waitlisted (gate-at-the-seat)
POST {{host}}/enrollments
Content-Type: application/json

{ "courseId": "CS301", "learnerId": "Erin" }

### Step 11 — Erin voluntarily drops off the waitlist before promotion — Expect: 200, Dropped
DELETE {{host}}/enrollments/CS301/Erin

### Step 12 — Drop Erin again — Expect: 404 (no record left)
DELETE {{host}}/enrollments/CS301/Erin

### Step 13 — Drop Frank, who was never enrolled or waitlisted — Expect: 404
DELETE {{host}}/enrollments/CS301/Frank

### Step 14 — Enroll Erin into CS302, capacity available, prerequisite unmet — Expect: 422
POST {{host}}/enrollments
Content-Type: application/json

{ "courseId": "CS302", "learnerId": "Erin" }

### Step 15 — Enroll Grace (never seeded) into CS301 — Expect: 404 (learner not found)
POST {{host}}/enrollments
Content-Type: application/json

{ "courseId": "CS301", "learnerId": "Grace" }

### Step 16 — Enroll Dave into CS999 (never seeded course) — Expect: 404 (course not found)
POST {{host}}/enrollments
Content-Type: application/json

{ "courseId": "CS999", "learnerId": "Dave" }

### Step 17 — Malformed body (missing courseId) — Expect: 400
POST {{host}}/enrollments
Content-Type: application/json

{ "courseId": "", "learnerId": "Dave" }

### Final status check for CS301 — Expect: enrolled=[Dave,Carol], waitlist=[]
GET {{host}}/courses/CS301/status

### Final status check for CS302 — Expect: enrolled=[], waitlist=[]
GET {{host}}/courses/CS302/status
